  "bodyHash": "42ac3afb2ca45a8c",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vg7xUZU.png\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Netherite-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"280\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Пожалуйста, используйте загрузку с CurseForge и не размещайте файлы на сторонних ресурсах.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод может использоваться в любых модпаках. (На CurseForge)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Версии для Fabric пока не планируется, извините.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Тем, кто просил пиксели ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Дополнение для Spartan Weaponry ➜</span><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Spartan Weaponry</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Доступны альтернативные текстуры ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Alternative</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;(Обновлено!)</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>ОПИСАНИЕ</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Добавляет броню, конскую броню, оружие и инструменты из ультимерита.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>РЕЦЕПТЫ СБОРКИ</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/650/ultimeriteingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/651/output_qajrzi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.19 :</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/652/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/653/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ЭФФЕКТЫ</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ультимерит</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Броня и конская броня</strong></em> : Эффекты от других видов брони. (Настраивается)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Оружие и инструменты</strong></em> : Эффекты от другого оружия и инструментов. (Настраивается)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Вы можете отключить или включить эффекты другой брони, оружия и инструментов, комбинируя их с компонентами в верстаке.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Золотой слиток</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Голдерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Стержень ифрита</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Блейзерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Жемчуг Эндера</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Эндерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Кристаллы призмарина</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Призмарита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Череп скелета-визера</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Визерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Паучий глаз</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Спайдерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Фантомная мембрана</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Фантерита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Перо</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Феферита</em></strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>НАСТРОЙКИ</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Клиент</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Файл <code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-client.toml</code> находится в <code>/config</code></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Сервер</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Файл <code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-server.toml</code> находится в <code>/saves/WORLD_NAME/serverconfigs</code></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Скопировав этот файл в папку <code>/defaultconfigs</code>, вы сможете применить эти настройки ко всем новым мирам.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">На выделенных серверах этот файл находится в <code>/world/serverconfigs</code></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>МОИ ДРУГИЕ МОДЫ</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 +</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Для старых версий</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
